## Explicit Memory Context
Storage happens only when the agent **calls the update_memory tool**. Trigger query: "I'm going through a legal process and need to organize my thoughts. The case involves divorce proceedings. My lawyer is Sarah Chen from Hart & Associa..."

- No update_memory in session 1 → score 1–2; suggest using the user-voice template and "call update_memory" / "remember" / "store".
